			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"茅葺一慶"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 726820101,
					"content": "嗨！那邊那位金髮異鄉人…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726820102,
						726820103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "茅葺一慶"
				},
				{
					"id": 726820102,
					"content": "又見面了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726820104
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 726820104,
					"content": "#嗯…{F#妳}{M#你}這頭金髮，愈看愈眼熟…難道是…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726820105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "茅葺一慶"
				},
				{
					"id": 726820105,
					"content": "啊，對了！是上次「百人一揆」中，表現無比亮眼的「黃金旋風」…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726820106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "茅葺一慶"
				},
				{
					"id": 726820106,
					"content": "黃、黃金旋風…？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726820107
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 726820107,
					"content": "#上次，我在亂鬥的場館一隅，觀察著參加者的活躍表現，想將其中最為精彩的場面收為素材。而{F#妳}{M#你}戰鬥的身姿，如刈草的黃金之風一般，橫掃各路敵手…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726820108,
						726820109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "茅葺一慶"
				},
				{
					"id": 726820108,
					"content": "奉承的話就免了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726820113
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 726820113,
					"content": "無論如何，最近又有好事之徒舉辦「百人一揆」了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726820114,
						726820118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "茅葺一慶"
				},
				{
					"id": 726820114,
					"content": "「百人一揆」是什麼？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726820115
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 726820115,
					"content": "透過酣暢淋漓的打鬥，來進行慶祝、或者消除晦氣的亂鬥大會。無論是武人還是魔物，都能摒棄成見不問身分，在其中為了純粹的熱血而混戰的祭典。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726820116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "茅葺一慶"
				},
				{
					"id": 726820116,
					"content": "在其中脫穎而出者，據說也能得到各種寶藏。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726820117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "茅葺一慶"
				},
				{
					"id": 726820117,
					"content": "但舉辦者、贊助者究竟是何許人也，至今都是謎團就是了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726820119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "茅葺一慶"
				},
				{
					"id": 726820119,
					"content": "總之，這些事情不適合在人多口雜的地方討論。跟我來…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "茅葺一慶"
				},
				{
					"id": 726820118,
					"content": "原來如此，我明白了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726820119
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 726820109,
					"content": "…再多說點？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726820110
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 726820110,
					"content": "咳咳…「想必觀眾當中擁有劍豪般動態視力的人已經看出來了，這位金髮異人所使用的正是在古武術中也被視為禁忌的『苟蘭茄大龍捲』…！」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726820111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "茅葺一慶"
				},
				{
					"id": 726820111,
					"content": "？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726820112
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 726820112,
					"content": "#這是受{F#妳}{M#你}戰鬥的身影啟發，而寫的情節。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726820113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "茅葺一慶"
				},
				{
					"id": 726820103,
					"content": "有什麼委託嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726820104
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7268202,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7268202
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7268202",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 7268202,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"茅葺一慶"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 726820201,
					"content": "我們到了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726820202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "茅葺一慶"
				},
				{
					"id": 726820202,
					"content": "只要踏入這扇看起來十分可疑的大門，就能進入這回的戰鬥場館。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726820203,
						726820204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "茅葺一慶"
				},
				{
					"id": 726820203,
					"content": "好興奮。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726820205
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 726820205,
					"content": "這次的規則和上次應該差不多。來自世界各地，渴求爭鬥的魔物、冒險者、戰士，在它的舞臺上酣暢淋漓地大打出手。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726820206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "茅葺一慶"
				},
				{
					"id": 726820206,
					"content": "#與之前一樣，{F#妳}{M#你}可以和志同道合的同伴、戰友一起去參戰。畢竟，所謂「百人」，自然是人數愈多愈好啦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726820207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "茅葺一慶"
				},
				{
					"id": 726820207,
					"content": "#我很期待{F#妳}{M#你}的表現。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726820208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "茅葺一慶"
				},
				{
					"id": 726820208,
					"content": "這次你也不參加嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726820209
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 726820209,
					"content": "#我嗎？我會以旁觀者的身分參與，為{F#妳}{M#你}喝彩。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726820210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "茅葺一慶"
				},
				{
					"id": 726820210,
					"content": "#畢竟，我的目標還是寫出最精彩的格鬥小說，而不是成為像{F#妳}{M#你}這樣耀眼的戰士。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726820211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "茅葺一慶"
				},
				{
					"id": 726820211,
					"content": "#而我的直覺告訴我，{F#妳}{M#你}一定會是格鬥場上最耀眼的明星。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726820212,
						726820213
					],
					"speakerTitle": "茅葺一慶"
				},
				{
					"id": 726820212,
					"content": "我會盡力。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726820214
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 726820214,
					"content": "#嗯。想必這次{F#妳}{M#你}也能展現出耀眼無比的劍之舞吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "茅葺一慶"
				},
				{
					"id": 726820213,
					"content": "拭目以待吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726820214
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 726820204,
					"content": "好麻煩。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726820205
					]
				}
			]
		}
	]
}